  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABC}$에서 $\\angle\\text{B}=90^\\circ$이고 빗변 $\\overline{\\text{AC}}=10$이다. (1) $\\sin A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AC}}} = \\frac{2}{5}$이므로 $\\overline{\\",
  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q21_solution",
      "condition": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABC}$에서 $\\angle\\text{B}=90^\\circ$이고 빗변 $\\overline{\\text{AC}}=10$이다. (1) $\\sin A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AC}}} = \\frac{2}{5}$이므로 $\\overline{\\text{BC}} = 10 \\times \\frac{2}{5} = 4$ (2) 피타고라스 정리에 의해 $\\overline{\\text{AB}} = \\sqrt{10^2 - 4^2} = \\sqrt{84} = 2\\sqrt{21}$ (3) $\\cos A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AB}}}{\\overline{\\text{AC}}} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{21}}{10} = \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{5}$ (4) $\\tan A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AB}}} = \\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{21}} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{21}}{21}$ (5) $\\sin C = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AB}}}{\\overline{\\text{AC}}} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{21}}{10} = \\frac{\\sqrt{21}}{5}$",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
